### 变量
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@accessToken = paste-login-or-switch-token-here
@spaceId = paste-space-id-from-get-org-spaces-here
@assetId = paste-asset-id-here
@knowledgeId = paste-knowledge-id-here

### 获取素材列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/assets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 创建外部 URL 素材
POST {{baseUrl}}/assets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "spaceId": "{{spaceId}}",
  "name": "测试素材 {{$timestamp}}",
  "type": "logo",
  "url": "https://cdn.example.com/assets/logo.png",
  "metadata": {
    "tags": ["logo", "brand"],
    "description": "品牌官方主 Logo"
  }
}

### 上传图片素材
POST {{baseUrl}}/assets/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----BrandFlowBoundary

------BrandFlowBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="example.webp"
Content-Type: image/webp

< ./example.webp
------BrandFlowBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="spaceId"

{{spaceId}}
------BrandFlowBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

夏季活动背景图
------BrandFlowBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="type"

background
------BrandFlowBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tags"

海报,夏季,背景
------BrandFlowBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

适合夏季促销海报的背景图
------BrandFlowBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="metadata"

{"source":"rest-client","width":1024,"height":1024}
------BrandFlowBoundary--

### 将素材保存为知识项
POST {{baseUrl}}/assets/{{assetId}}/save-to-knowledge
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "knowledgeId": "{{knowledgeId}}",
  "description": "沉淀到知识库的素材说明"
}

### 删除素材
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/assets/{{assetId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
